<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="4">
<title><%= appName %> – Backup läuft</title>
<%- include('partials/favicon') %>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body {
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; background: #f4f4f5; color: #1f2328;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background: #18181b; color: #e4e4e7; } }
  .box { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; max-width: 26rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  p { opacity: .7; margin: 0; font-size: .9rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1><%= appName %> – Backup läuft …</h1>
    <p>Ein Admin sichert gerade Dokumente und Datenbank. Das dauert normalerweise
      nur kurz — diese Seite lädt sich automatisch neu.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
